<title>USA: Colonial BancGroup agrees to acquire ASB.</title>
<headline>Colonial BancGroup agrees to acquire ASB.</headline>
<dateline>MONTGOMERY, Ala. 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colonial BancGroup said on Wednesday it signed a letter of intent to acquire ASB Bancshares of Ashville, Ala., for stock and debt securities.</p>
<p>Exact terms of the deal were not disclosed. Colonial said in a news release that ASB's subsidiary Ashville Savings Bank had $142 million in assets.</p>
<p>The transaction is subject to a definitive agreement and approval from regulators and ASB Bancshares shareholders.</p>
</text>
